162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (This project focuses on the Financial Statement Analysis of Tata Consultancy Services \(TCS\) Limited for the last three financial years, from FY 2023-24 to FY 2025-26. The main purpose of the project is to understand and evaluate the financial performance and position of TCS using its financial statements. The study covers the Income Statement, Balance Sheet and Cash Flow Statement and analyses important financial ratios related to profitability, liquidity, solvency and efficiency. The project also examines year-on-year growth in revenue, operating profit, net profit, total assets, total equity and operating cash flow. In addition, the financial strengths, risks, limitations and recommendations of TCS are discussed. The analysis helps in understanding the company's financial stability, operational performance and overall growth prospects.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
