/P 148 0 R
/E (The financial statement analysis of Tata Consultancy Services \(TCS\) Limited for the last three years, from FY 2023-24 to FY 2025-26, shows that the company has maintained a strong and stable financial position. TCS has achieved growth in revenue, operating profit, net profit, total assets, total equity and operating cash flow. The ratio analysis also indicates strong profitability, liquidity and financial stability. However, the company experienced slower revenue and net profit growth in FY 2025-26. TCS should focus on AI, cloud services, digital transformation, cost control and expansion into new markets. Overall, TCS has strong financial fundamentals, low financial risk and good potential for sustainable long-term growth.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [1]
